# Line endings are LF in the index and in every checkout, Windows included (B-162).
# The gates read docs and sources line by line, the pre-push hook is a shell script
# Git for Windows runs with its own sh, and a CRLF checkout breaks both.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never converted, never diffed as text. tools/ci.test.ts fails when Git
# finds a binary file in the index whose type is not listed here.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.xpi binary
*.crx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.onnx binary
